.SH NAME
SystemEx.Collections.Generic.VectorSet< T, TContainer > \- Equivalent to a std::flat_set, but implemented as an open, non-owning sorted view over any IContainerEx instance\&. The Set struct does not store elements itself; it maintains ordering by sorting the referenced container using either a user-provided sorting delegate or a built-in BubbleSort fallback when no delegate is supplied\&.  

