.SS "IVector< T > SystemEx\&.Collections\&.Generic\&.VectorSet< T, TContainer >\&.GetSorted ()"

.PP
Returns a sorted value copy of the underlying container\&. The Set container maintains its elements in sorted order at all times\&. This method therefore does not perform any additional sorting\&. Instead, it returns a structural duplicate of the internal container using its copy constructor, ensuring that the returned instance is independent and does not reference the original storage\&.

.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
A new \fBIVector<T>\fP instance containing the same elements as the underlying container, already sorted\&. 
.RE
.PP

